Prediction Market Trading System — Public Portfolio Snapshot

This repository is a sanitized derivative of a larger private software system.
It is published for portfolio and code-review purposes.

Intentionally excluded or generalized:
- production trading parameters and sizing rules
- asset-specific setup families
- historical GOOD/BAD trade corpora
- proprietary admission thresholds and strategy logic
- private operational data, credentials, and production logs

The standalone public entrypoint is intentionally observe-only and does not
provide turnkey live trading behavior.

Third-party libraries and services remain subject to their respective licenses
and terms. No license to proprietary/private strategy material is granted by
this repository.
